{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>相簿塞滿重複相片、巨型影片與堆積多時的截圖，令 iPhone 儲存空間再度告急。Cleanup &amp; Declutter My Photos 正是針對這類收納困擾而設，一次掃描即可找出各類多餘內容，適合經常為儲存空間煩惱的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>一鍵清除重複相片與截圖</h2>\n<p>掃描全程在裝置上完成，相片不會上傳雲端，亦毋須註冊帳戶。智能建議先顯示可回收空間，再一鍵清除重複與模糊相片；Smart Merge 自動保留最佳版本並合併其餘副本。亦可按檔案大小排序，找出佔用大量容量的巨型影片，或按月清除堆積截圖。刪除前均須經你確認，掌控權始終在你手上。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-167-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-168-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-169-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-170-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-171-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-172-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cleanup &amp; Declutter My Photos</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T04:38:44.710073+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}